# CodeGraph

This project uses [CodeGraph](https://github.com/colbymchenry/codegraph) (`.codegraph/`). The MCP server auto-syncs on file changes — no manual re-index step.

## Before exploring the codebase

Use CodeGraph MCP tools **before** grep/read loops:

| Intent | Tool |
|--------|------|
| How does X work? / architecture / flow | `codegraph_explore` |
| Locate a symbol by name | `codegraph_search` |
| What calls this? / blast radius | `codegraph_callers` / `codegraph_impact` |
| What does this call? | `codegraph_callees` |
| One symbol's full source | `codegraph_node` (with `includeCode`) |
| Index health / pending sync | `codegraph_status` |

Trust CodeGraph results — do not re-verify with grep. If a response includes a staleness banner for edited files, `Read` those specific files only.

Answer structural questions directly with one `codegraph_explore` call when possible; avoid delegating to explore subagents for symbol lookup.

